    "row1": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 2260,
      "text": "1 · First launch: see it, then learn by playing",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 40
    },
    "row1note": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 760,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Dropku in 5 lines\n\n1. Sudoku rule: each number once per row, column and box.\n2. You don't tap cells. Pick a number, tap a COLUMN, and it falls to the lowest gap.\n3. So the ORDER matters: fill the lower gaps first.\n4. WIN: fill the grid before the countdown hits 0s.\n5. LOSE: time's up, or 3 wrong drops (each one cracks and costs a heart).\n\nPress Play on screens 3, 4 and 7. They really work.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 300
    },
    "row2": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 2260,
      "text": "2 · The core loop: play, win or lose, go again",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1304
    },
    "row2note": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 700,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "The winning \"hit\"\n\n• Every correct drop: a weighty landing plus a haptic tick.\n• Finish a row, column or box: flash, chime, +1 Spark (once each, so undo can't farm).\n• One drop finishing 2 or 3 at once: DOUBLE (+3) / TRIPLE (+8).\n• Countdown turns amber at 30s and red with ticks at 10s.\n• Level end: stars fill one by one, seconds left turn into Sparks.",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 1564
    },
    "row3": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 2260,
      "text": "3 · Rewards, Sparks and settings",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2568
    },
    "row3note": {
      "fill": "green",
      "maxH": 700,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Sparks economy (to tune in beta)\n\nEarn: level 10 · no mistakes +10 · 1 per 5s left (max 20) · lines +1, combos +3/+8 · Daily Drop +25 · milestone chest 100–250. A perfect level is about 50.\n\nSpend: hint 40 · +30 seconds 50 · +1 heart 60 · SKIP LEVEL 400. Continues: once per attempt.\n\nOr pay: skip now, Sparks packs, or \"Dropku Complete\". All through Apple In-App Purchase. Chest contents are fixed, never random.",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 2828
    }
